{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Uzip 是一款專為 iPhone 檔案管理而設的壓縮與解壓工具，適合需要處理同事傳來的 ZIP、分享前壓縮資料夾，或把 RAR 壓縮檔轉成 ZIP 的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-5.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一站式檔案壓縮解壓</h2>\n<p>Uzip 可把檔案與資料夾壓縮成 ZIP，並即時解壓 ZIP、RAR 及 7Z 檔案；支援一鍵把 RAR 轉為 ZIP，亦可瀏覽 iPhone 檔案系統、從相簿匯入相片與影片，或直接用相機拍攝並壓縮。用戶可多選檔案批次壓縮或分享，並在解壓前預覽壓縮檔內容。操作集中於單一畫面，沒有廣告，亦不設訂閱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Uzip</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/uzip/id6767870303?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.797811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":301,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T21:59:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:17.220630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:06.811193+00:00","content_hash":"a4240720cfe95bf47d57d1b5afc29060b247bf11318b7d826f2cf313500030bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}